+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold verbatim; `memory submit` replaces
+     these placeholder comments with real content and fills the required frontmatter fields. -->
+
+Three reports, each a divergence from the README rules:
+
+1. Lower-case SKU refused: `Catalog.find` only trimmed; it now uses `canonicalSku` (case-insensitive).
+2. Delivery charged at exactly €50.00: `shippingCost` used `>`; free shipping is now `>=` the threshold.
+3. VAT one cent low (€1.99 → €0.43): `lineVat` rounded down; it now uses `percentOf` (half up).
+
+Tests: `test/reports-fixes.test.ts` (characterised red before the fixes); full suite passes.
